Hi,

I applied another clean-up patches to CVS.

Now MODULE_SYNTAX() and MODULE_CLASSES() are removed from the codes,
since they won't be supported any more (they were anyway unofficial
macros to output to generic_string file).

Also, MODULE_DEVICES() is replaced with MODULE_SUPPORTED_DEVICE().

If you have a local copy of your driver, please sync with the CVS.


thanks,

Takashi


